{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724990/extras/FVC_Graphic_Steam_Banner-2_V5.gif?t=1747960454\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BUILD A FACTORY THAT MAKES MUSIC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Future Vibe Check, every object you place contributes to an evolving soundscape. Creating music is connected to automation mechanics and automation will help you make better music. Efficiency and harmony go hand in hand. Yin and Yang. Ebb and Flow. You get it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This free demo contains some introductory content from the Future Vibe Check upcoming release. Share feedback and spread the VIBE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724990/extras/FVC_Graphic_Steam_Banner-1_V5.gif?t=1747960454\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GO MONK MODE WITH LOGISTICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The gang's all here. Belts, inserters, mergers, launchers, and more! But here, logistics isn\u2019t just about efficiency. Musical networks weave through your factory and make every logistic puzzle a symphony of spatial reasoning. Can you balance production and rhythm to make a vibe?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724990/extras/FVC_Graphic_Steam_GIF-2-Music_616x220_V1.gif?t=1747960454\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORE AN ESOTERIC WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our material world is building to a crescendo of the surreal\u2014a chaotic symphony where the rhythm of reality feels off-key, and human creativity is fading into a muted climax. In this discordant mess,  Infinity calls on you to achieve enlightenment by making the right vibe. Unlock your chakras, reconnect with your divine creativity, and weave sacred patterns into the music to rescue us from a silent, digital end.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724990/extras/FVC_Graphic_Steam_GIF-1-Automation_616x220_V2.gif?t=1747960454\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WHY YOU'LL LOVE IT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore Music</strong><i>:</i>\u00a0You don't need to know any music theory -- there's a mad smart music engine powering things under the hood. It'll make everything sound right  from key to scale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rhythm Game Infused:</strong> Say goodbye to tedious mining. Engage in rhythm and pitch minigames to gather resources and keep the beat flowing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Defense Meets Disco:</strong>\u00a0As your factory grows, the Vibe Stealers will threaten it. No pressure, though! There are tons of options to safeguard the Vibe at your own pace.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724990/extras/FVC_Graphic_Steam_GIF-4-Aesthetic_616x220_V2.gif?t=1747960454\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The future will be based on vibes. You are both the maker and the music. Watch the universe dance to your beat.</strong>\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3724990?t=1747960454","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3724990?t=1747960454","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724990/7437eac011a7ff4d647cca6af2fa29de12f76cc8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747960454","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724990/7437eac011a7ff4d647cca6af2fa29de12f76cc8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747960454","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"des